blocks.english:
Bring strength to Thy languishing people;
Pour forth abundant health upon peoples;
As is Thy wont, restore the sick
To their former strength.

Let every assault depart utterly;
Let every tormenting onslaught melt away;
May the freshness of desired health cherish
The sufferer’s limbs.

Now, O God, have mercy upon our weeping
For those whom we now ask Thee to heal;
That every sick person lying down
May feel Thy remedy;

